'''Corey J. Atkins''' (born November 11, 1976) is an American former [[American football|football]] [[linebacker]] who played one season with the [[Atlanta Falcons]] of the [[National Football League]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Corey Atkins Stats|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/A/AtkiCo20.htm|access-date=2022-02-20|website=Pro-Football-Reference.com|language=en}}</ref> He also played for the [[Barcelona Dragons (NFL Europe)|Barcelona Dragons]] of [[NFL Europe]] for one season.<ref>{{Cite web|title=2001 Barcelona Dragons football Roster on StatsCrew.com|url=https://www.statscrew.com/football/roster/t-WLAFBAR/y-2001|access-date=2022-02-20|website=www.statscrew.com|language=en}}</ref>
